# This repository's declaration of what it takes from productforge-config, and its own
# values. Dotenv: read by make, by Docker Compose and by `update`.
# Kits, space-separated: python, shell, django-api, flutter-web, release. `common` is
# always taken and never named.
PF_KITS=python django-api
PF_SLOT=3
PF_NAME=fixture_api
# Optional, each defaulting to PF_NAME:
# PF_DJANGO_PROJECT=
# PF_POSTGRES_DB=
